{#- How to read a value off ashrae-meteo.info. Set ashrae_find (HTML: which
    table and column to read) and ashrae_units before including this;
    ashrae_summary (optional) replaces the heading. -#}
<details class="ashrae-steps">
  <summary>{{ ashrae_summary | default("How to find this on the ASHRAE site") }}</summary>
  <ol>
    <li>Open <a href="https://ashrae-meteo.info/v3.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ASHRAE Climatic Design Conditions</a>.</li>
    <li>Select the edition year you want, usually the newest, or the one your energy code calls for.</li>
    <li>Click {{ ashrae_units | safe }}.</li>
    <li>Right click your location on the map, or use the magnifying glass to search for it.</li>
    <li>Select the nearest weather station from the list.</li>
    <li>Scroll down to {{ ashrae_find | safe }}</li>
  </ol>
</details>
